# android/ is untracked entirely (Expo CNG regenerates it from app.json),
# but if it's ever committed, none of these should go with it: they all
# bake in machine-specific absolute paths (a Windows "C:\dev\..." path on
# this machine breaks a Linux EAS builder, and vice versa), and the .cxx/
# CMake caches and hs_err_pid crash dumps are pure local-build noise.
android/.cxx/
android/.gradle/
android/build/
android/app/build/
android/app/.cxx/
android/local.properties
**/android/.cxx/
hs_err_pid*.log
replay_pid*.log
